# ============================================================================
# Helbreath Xsilium - .gitignore
#
# OJO: .gitignore solo afecta a archivos NUEVOS. Los que ya estan en el repo
# hay que sacarlos una vez con "git rm -r --cached" (ver docs o el chat).
# ============================================================================

# --- Carpetas nuestras que no se suben ---------------------------------------
docs/
**/Depuracion/
*.dmp

# --- Visual Studio: caches, estado del IDE y ajustes por usuario -------------
.vs/
**/.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.vsidx
*.ipch
ipch/
*.aps
**/enc_temp_folder/

# --- Restos de compilacion (se regeneran en cada build) ----------------------
*.obj
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild
*.idb
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.pch
*.cache
*.log
*.res
[SRC]MapServer/Debug/
[SRC]MapServer/Release/
[SRC]Nucleo/Debug/
[SRC]Nucleo/Release/
[SRC]Client Version 13/x64/
[SRC]Client Version 13/Release/
[SRC]Client Version 13/CxImage/Debug/
[SRC]Client Version 13/CxImage/Release/
[SRC]Client Version 13/jpeg/Debug/
[SRC]Client Version 13/jpeg/Release/
# Ojo: [SRC]Client Version 13/Debug/ NO se ignora entera: ahi estan SPRITES,
# SOUNDS, MAPDATA... Solo se ignoran sus .obj/.tlog/.pdb por extension.

# --- Ejecutables que produce la compilacion ----------------------------------
# Descomenta si prefieres no subirlos (quien clone tendra que compilar):
# MapServer/MapServer.exe
# Nucleo/Nucleo.exe
# [SRC]Client Version 13/Archive/Helbreath Xsilium.exe

# --- Datos que genera el servidor al jugar -----------------------------------
**/ServerLogs/
**/Nucleo/Account/
**/Nucleo/Character/
/Accounts/
MapServer/Error.Log
MapServer/log.txt

# --- Basura del sistema ------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
Xsilium.zip
CLAUDE.md